<view class="container edit-page">
  <view class="edit-intro"><view class="edit-badge reward-badge"><icon name="gift" size="38" color="#14343D"/></view><text class="eyebrow">和孩子一起定目标</text><text class="page-title">添加奖励</text><text class="intro-hint">选一个孩子期待的小奖励，再决定它需要多少积分。</text></view>
  <view class="form-section"><view class="form-item"><text class="label">奖励名称</text><input class="input" placeholder="例如：周末选一部电影" bindinput="onNameInput" value="{{formData.name}}" cursor-spacing="24"/></view><view class="form-item"><text class="label">奖励分类</text><picker mode="selector" range="{{categories}}" range-key="name" bindchange="onCategoryChange"><view class="picker-value">{{selectedCategoryName || '选择最合适的分类'}}<text>⌄</text></view></picker></view><view class="form-item"><text class="label">兑换所需积分</text><view class="points-input"><input class="input" type="number" placeholder="50" bindinput="onPointsInput" value="{{formData.points}}" cursor-spacing="24"/><text>积分</text></view></view><view class="form-item"><text class="label">补充说明 <text class="optional">选填</text></text><textarea class="textarea" placeholder="说明奖励内容或使用规则" bindinput="onDescInput" value="{{formData.description}}" cursor-spacing="24"/></view></view>
  <view class="form-hint"><icon name="info" size="28" color="#2A808A"/><text>兑换时会从孩子的可用积分中扣除对应积分。</text></view>
  <button class="save-button" bindtap="onSubmit" loading="{{loading}}">创建奖励</button>
  <!-- 键盘占位：撑出可滚动余量，把输入框推到键盘之上（收起时高度为 0） -->
  <view class="keyboard-spacer" style="height: {{keyboardHeight}}px"></view>
</view>
